      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IM EL ARQUERO (1) came from the back row to win the QBred Triad Final at Albion Park three back and has had wide draws since but still managed to place in a handy line-up two back at Bathurst. He should get every chance from the ace draw. TUAPEKA GOLD (5) had to work when racing parked but boxed on for fourth when resuming in a heat of this series here. Won his lone second-up attempt so should be improved. An early gallop blew the chances of CHANGES (12) last start but he had put together a string of wins or placings prior. Has to contend with a wide draw but with manners and even luck he can bounce back. ATOMIK CRUNCH (10) draws wide but managed a second in the Tatlow Stakes the last time he raced here.",
